{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, כְּ","hw":"כְּ","html":"<big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">כְּ</span></big></big>  <strong>part. like, as, about (</strong>BH <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּ</span>, q.v.<strong>)</strong>;—<em>like, as</em>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:40\" href=\"/Daniel.2.40\">Dn 2:40</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּקִּיפָא כְּפַרְזְלָא</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:5\" href=\"/Daniel.4.5\">4:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:32\" href=\"/Daniel.4.32\">32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:11\" href=\"/Daniel.5.11\">5:11</a> +; <em>according to</em> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:32\" href=\"/Daniel.4.32\">4:32</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּכְמִצְבְּיֵהּ עָבֵד</span> and <em>according to</em> his will he doeth, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:9\" href=\"/Ezra.6.9\">Ezr 6:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 6:18\" href=\"/Ezra.6.18\">18</a> +; <em>about</em> (as BH <strong>1 a</strong>: cf. Zinj. Lzb<sup>444</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">כשלשן מלך</span>[<span dir=\"rtl\">ן</span>]), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:16\" href=\"/Daniel.4.16\">Dn 4:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּשָׁעָה חֲדָה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:1\" href=\"/Daniel.6.1\">6:1</a>; with inf. (BH <strong>3 b</strong>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 6:21\" href=\"/Daniel.6.21\">6:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וּכְמִקְרְבֵהּ לְגֻבָּא</span> and <em>as</em> he drew near, etc. Cpds.:—<span dir=\"rtl\">כְּדִי</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּדְנָה</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, דִּי\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_דִּי\", dir=\"rtl\">דִּי</a> and <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, דְּנָה\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_דְּנָה\", dir=\"rtl\">דְּנָה</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחֲדָה</span> <em>together</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, חֲדִי\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_חֲדִי\", dir=\"rtl\">חַד</a> (sub <a data-ref=\"BDB Aramaic, אחד\" href=\"/BDB Aramaic,_אחד\", dir=\"rtl\">אחד</a>).","next":"BDB Aramaic, כְּדַב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, יַתִּיר"}